('614', '2', 'easy', 'A trader marks an item 21% above cost price and gives a 11% discount. What is the net profit percentage?', NULL, NULL, '9%', '13%', '16%', '19%', 'A', 'Net Profit % = Marked % - Discount % - (Marked % * Discount % / 100) per TCS NQT standard.', '45', '0', '0', 'TCS NQT PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'TCS NQT'),
