('842', '5', 'easy', 'Pointing to a man, a lady says: \'His sister is my mother\'s only daughter.\' How is the lady related to the man?', NULL, NULL, 'Sister', 'Mother', 'Aunt', 'Niece', 'A', 'Direct relation deduction as seen in LTI Mindtree interview assessments.', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('843', '6', 'easy', 'Complete the pattern: 10, 20, 40, 80, ?', NULL, NULL, '160', '120', '180', '200', 'A', 'Geometric series multiplier pattern (x2) common in LTI Mindtree written tests.', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('844', '7', 'easy', '\'Cloud computing lowers infrastructure capital expenditure by enabling pay-as-you-go elastic resources.\' What is the key financial benefit?', NULL, NULL, 'Lower capital expenditure', 'Higher hardware maintenance', 'Static resource allocation', 'Manual scaling delay', 'A', 'Direct inference from paragraph as evaluated in LTI Mindtree verbal tests.', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('845', '8', 'easy', 'Identify the error: \'The manager along with his team members (have / has) arrived at the client office.\'', NULL, NULL, 'Use \'has\' because \'manager\' is the singular subject', 'Use \'have\' because of \'team members\'', 'Replace \'arrived\' with \'arriving\'', 'No error', 'A', 'Subject-verb agreement rule: \'along with\' doesn\'t pluralize the primary subject (LTI Mindtree pattern).', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('846', '9', 'easy', 'A table shows sales revenue for Q1=$180M and Q2=$230M. Find the percentage growth.', NULL, NULL, '27.78%', '32.78%', '24.78%', '37.78%', 'A', 'Quarterly growth percentage formula applied for LTI Mindtree data interpretation.', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('847', '10', 'medium', 'In LTI Mindtree code language, \'DATA\' is written as \'FCVC\'. How is \'CODE\' written?', NULL, NULL, 'EQFG', 'EPFG', 'FQGH', 'DPEF', 'A', '+2 letter shift rule (C+2=E, O+2=Q, D+2=F, E+2=G -> EQFG) used by LTI Mindtree.', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('848', '11', 'medium', 'A delivery agent drives 20 km East, turns North and drives 15 km, then drives 20 km West. Where is he relative to start?', NULL, NULL, '15 km North', '15 km South', '20 km East', '20 km West', 'A', 'East and West cancel out, leaving 15 km North (LTI Mindtree problem).', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('849', '12', 'medium', 'Pipe A fills a tank in 21 mins, Pipe B empties it in 31 mins. If both open together, how long to fill?', NULL, NULL, '65.1 mins', '70.1 mins', '62.099999999999994 mins', '75.1 mins', 'A', 'Net fill rate = 1/A - 1/B. Total time = (A*B)/(B-A) mins (LTI Mindtree quantitative style).', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree'),
('850', '13', 'medium', 'Choose the synonym of \'METICULOUS\':', NULL, NULL, 'Careful and precise', 'Careless and rushed', 'Loud and aggressive', 'Slow and lazy', 'A', 'Meticulous means showing great attention to detail (LTI Mindtree vocabulary bank).', '45', '0', '0', 'LTI Mindtree PYQ', '2026-09-18 08:01:45', '1', 'LTI Mindtree');
